{{!
    @template filter_saylorcode/embed_link

    Link-only presentation of an embedded exercise, used when an author writes
    mode=link. Useful inside a Lesson page or a dense reading, where an inline
    editor would interrupt rather than help.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * exercise string Stable exercise id.
    * activityurl string Link to the stand alone exercise.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "exercise": "CS101-U05-E03",
        "activityurl": "https://example.org/local/saylorcode/exercise.php?stableid=CS101-U05-E03"
    }
}}
<p class="saylorcode-embed-linkonly">
    <a href="{{activityurl}}" data-exercise="{{exercise}}">
        {{#str}}openexercise, filter_saylorcode{{/str}}
    </a>
</p>
